  "review_scope": "Gold with a fading tonal checker field over the upper body/sleeves, blue piping and blue/gold cuff and ring colors. Every repeated stag-head emblem inside the checker squares is removed, as are crest, sponsor and manufacturer. Source polo construction is not drawn over the PNG. Fade simplified to flat opacity steps. All palette values are visual estimates. Paint adapts the observed color layout to the unchanged original PNG; no second physical collar is drawn.",
  "limitations": "Colors and placement are visual adaptations; original PNG round collar, fabric and folds retained.",
